# {{lb|mul|Thai Braille}} {{m|mul|◌ะ|sc=Thai|tr=a}}
# {{lb|mul|Korean Braille}} Final {{m|ko|ㄱ}}

====Usage notes====
* {{qualifier|Thai Braille}} As in print, this is combined with many other vowels to indicate they are short.

